# Create a Monitor profile you want in this directory, as a Lua file (e.g. Office.lua, Mirror.lua)
# using hl.monitor({ output = "...", mode = "...", position = "...", scale = ... }) rules.
# See https://wiki.hypr.land/Configuring/Basics/Monitors/
#
# Pick one with SUPER SHIFT E -> "Choose Monitor Profiles": it is copied to ~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua
# and Hyprland reloads. Suggest not to call your own profile "default".
